# Decaying Soil with threshold (Brain Freeze with storm 6 on Bot1 on turn 1). On turn 4 Bot2 Lightning Bolts Bot1's
# Ornithopter and the Soil's trigger goes on the stack; in response Bot2's Deathrite Shaman exiles the Ornithopter card
# from the graveyard. When the trigger resolves Bot1 is still offered to pay {1} (the card's text asks nothing about
# where the card is) and pays it, but "that card" is no longer in the graveyard -- the one in exile is a new object
# (CR 400.7) -- so it is not returned: Bot1's hand stays empty and the Ornithopter stays in exile (beside the Island the Soil's upkeep trigger exiled on turn 3).

